# Implementation Plan - Fix shopId Mismatch

Resolving the critical bug where medicines are saved with an incorrect or hardcoded `shopId`, making them invisible in the dashboard.

## Proposed Changes

### [API] Bulk Insertion
Ensure `shopId` is correctly pulled from the authenticated user and logged.

#### [MODIFY] [bulk-insert/route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/medicines/bulk-insert/route.ts)
- Add logging for `auth.user.shopId` and the `shopId` used in Prisma calls.
- Verify that every [create](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/middleware/auth.ts#79-90), [update](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/components/MoveToInventoryModal.tsx#74-79), and `findFirst` call uses `user.shopId`.

### [API] Medicines Search
Ensure the search API uses the same `shopId` as the bulk-insert.

#### [MODIFY] [search/route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/medicines/search/route.ts)
- Add logging for the `shopId` used during the search query.
- Confirm it resolves correctly from the auth context.

### [API] Clear All
Ensure the clear-all logic is scoped correctly to the user's `shopId`.

#### [MODIFY] [clear-all/route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/medicines/clear-all/route.ts)
- Verify and add logging for the `shopId` used in deletion operations.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build`.

### Manual Verification
- Perform a bulk import and check server logs for the saved `shopId`.
- Load the medicines page and check logs for the fetch `shopId`.
- Confirm they match and the newly imported medicines are visible.
